{"start": 408.85, "end": 412.25, "text": "There were six Marines standing there, man, respectful young men, I'm going to say in", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 412.25, "end": 413.77, "text": "their early 20s.", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 413.77, "end": 416.41, "text": "And they were offered, you know, to go on the plane first and they did, so they took", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 416.41, "end": 417.99, "text": "off and went on the plane.", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 417.99, "end": 420.45, "text": "We get on the plane and here's what the pilot tells us.", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 420.45, "end": 421.45, "text": "I'm not making this up.", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 421.45, "end": 423.97, "text": "He said, we're going from Chicago to Springfield, Missouri.", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 423.97, "end": 426.69, "text": "He said, the ceilings are like 200 feet.", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 426.69, "end": 430.73, "text": "We probably won't be able to get into Springfield or no, he actually said, we're going to try", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 430.73, "end": 434.81, "text": "for Springfield, pilot's exact words at the gate in the microphone.", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 434.81, "end": 438.42, "text": "We probably won't make it.", "avg_logprob": -0.127, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014, "compression_ratio": 1.8481}
{"start": 438.42, "end": 441.16, "text": "really what you want to hear from your pilot.", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 441.16, "end": 443.76, "text": "He says, don't worry, we'll just go on to Dallas.", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 443.76, "end": 448.3, "text": "So I mean, everybody, everything, every, tension, that's what I love about laughter.", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 448.3, "end": 450.58, "text": "Laughter relieves tension.", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 450.58, "end": 453.62, "text": "Like some of you have been laughing three, five laughs a minute, you're enjoying things", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 453.62, "end": 456.54, "text": "right now, your whole body is relaxing.", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 456.54, "end": 459.41, "text": "I'm like, that's my goal, I'm going to get this whole plane laughing.", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 459.41, "end": 462.87, "text": "We sit down in our seats and we don't know for sure if we're going anywhere.", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 462.87, "end": 464.93, "text": "It's getting close to midnight.", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 464.93, "end": 468.16, "text": "And I sit down and my tray table is broken.", "avg_logprob": -0.1765, "no_speech_prob": 0.0496, "compression_ratio": 1.7169}
{"start": 468.16, "end": 470.19, "text": "It has the tape on it.", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 470.19, "end": 472.61, "text": "And so I'm like, oh, this is good.", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 472.61, "end": 473.61, "text": "Now Amy's laughing.", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 473.61, "end": 475.05, "text": "She knows I'm just in one of my moods.", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 475.05, "end": 480.94, "text": "And I go, this is unacceptable.", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 480.94, "end": 486.66, "text": "I refuse to take off with a broken tray table.", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 486.66, "end": 488.38, "text": "I'm going to go say something to the pilot.", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 488.38, "end": 491.98, "text": "I want maintenance on board fixing this tray table.", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 491.98, "end": 494.58, "text": "This guy, about 60 years old, standing in the aisle next to", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 494.58, "end": 496.58, "text": "me, and I'm not making up a word of this, leans down.", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 496.58, "end": 500.18, "text": "And he goes, if you say anything, I will get one of", "avg_logprob": -0.1001, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.6321}
{"start": 500.18, "end": 515.16, "text": "Marines to murder you. And then I'll have another one drag your dead body off this", "avg_logprob": -0.2292, "no_speech_prob": 0.113, "compression_ratio": 1.1786}
{"start": 515.16, "end": 523.57, "text": "plane. Relieving tension. Enjoying life together.", "avg_logprob": -0.2292, "no_speech_prob": 0.113, "compression_ratio": 1.1786}
